# Never commit a real key.
.z-ai-config

# The original build spec contains a live GitHub personal access token, so it is
# deliberately kept out of git history. Revoke that token and the file is safe
# to commit if you want it tracked.
buddy-spec.md

*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Kept out of git only because the token used to push this repo has `repo` scope
# but not `workflow` scope, and GitHub refuses such a token any write under
# .github/workflows/. The file is real and correct — see "Adding the release
# workflow" in README.md. Delete this line once you push with a token that has
# the `workflow` scope, then commit the file normally.
.github/workflows/release.yml
